00:11:56.110 --> 00:12:13.120
<v Elna Baker>They are men who are chosen by the church to volunteer their time and serve as basically pastors for a two-to-five-year period. They keep their regular jobs. One of my bishops, a good one, was a food scientist who helped invent Pop Rocks. Another was an investment banker named Chad.
<v Elna Baker>他们是被教会选中的人，自愿贡献时间，在两到五年内担任牧师。他们还有正式工作。我的一位主教，是个好人，是发明“跳跳糖”的食品科学家。另一位叫查德，是个投资银行家。

